---
description: Coach Connect neobrutalist redesign. Apply when editing UI screens or components.
alwaysApply: false
globs: ["src/**/*.jsx", "src/**/*.js"]
---
Follow docs/design/DESIGN.md for every UI change. Visual STYLE reference only: docs/design/mockups/index.html (source-screens.js, source-styles.css). Do not copy its layouts. Keep each screen's existing structure, sections, order, content and navigation, and apply the look to what is already there.
- Use the shared Nb* components in src/look-and-feel. Never hand-roll buttons, chips, cards or segmented controls.
- Colors and gradients come from tokens only. No raw hex in screens. No solid accent fills.
- Keep behavior, data, navigation and screen structure unchanged. Visual pass only (the wheel scheduler replacement is the one requested structural change).
- Keep existing icons and the items listed under "Keep as they are".
- Text must never clip: chips and buttons are single line with 16 horizontal padding; touch targets 44 minimum.
- Check light and dark for every screen you touch.
